  "description": "LEVELS OF ASSISTANCE The three levels of assistance allow you to manage the electric support in an optimal way, together with the Walk Assistance mode which allows you to have an easier start on uphill sections or with loaded bags. MOTOR The REAR HUB rear hub motor develops a power of 250W and a torque of 45 Nm at a weight of just over 3 kg. Compact and versatile, it does not require any special ordinary maintenance. BATTERY The 504 Wh battery is installed and integrates seamlessly into the down tube and can be charged via the charging jack both when mounted on the bike and once removed from the frame. Range up to 90 km in optimal trail/cyclist conditions.\n\nBE GREEN TECHNOLOGIES 27.5\" e-city aluminum frame with a battery seamlessly integrated into the down tube for a clean, compact design. Easy to handle and comfortable to ride, it's comfortable even on rough surfaces thanks to the front suspension fork. A rack, mudguards, and lighting system provide excellent standard equipment for all your daily commutes. The rear hub motor ensures a smooth and reliable ride, perfect for reaching your daily destinations with an extra boost. IDEAL FOR YOU It is the pedal-assisted city bike ideal for urban routes, for daily journeys and for moving easily through city center traffic. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you're looking for a practical and versatile e-city to get around faster on short trips, at an affordable price.",
